jobs.description:
As a logistics employee, you help keep the logistics process running smoothly. You handle goods with care and make sure everything is ready for shipment. Your main tasks include:

- Handling goods: Loading, unloading, moving, and preparing products for delivery.
- Keeping order: Scanning materials, checking inventory, and organizing the workplace.
- Following rules: Working safely, following instructions, and using protective gear when needed.

- Approximately 3+ years of work-experience in a logistic environment;
- Able to communicate in English B1/B2 level;
- Driving license (car) is preferred;
- Available for working 2 shifts;
- Soft-skills that match with the company-culture: teamplayer, proactive and motivated
